# 4. CodeMindIDE Vision

CodeMindIDE creates an AI SDLC control plane.

It ensures every significant AI-driven change follows a governed lifecycle:

1. Understand the request
2. Select the right persona
3. Route to the correct playbook
4. Perform controlled implementation
5. Run quality validation
6. Run security validation
7. Record audit evidence
8. Report token usage
9. Approve, conditionally approve, or block output

**Speaker Notes:**  
This turns AI work into a traceable engineering workflow.

