# 7. Persona-Based Execution Model

CodeMindIDE uses five logical personas.

| Persona | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| Orchestrator | Classifies request, selects workflow, defines success criteria |
| Developer | Implements approved code changes only |
| Quality Enforcer | Validates tests, linting, maintainability, Sonar rules |
| Security Validator | Checks secrets, auth, injection, unsafe patterns |
| Auditor | Confirms evidence, traceability, and final verdict |

Mandatory behavior:

```text
Active persona: Developer — implementing approved scope.
```

**Speaker Notes:**  
The persona model prevents Copilot from behaving like a single uncontrolled assistant.

