# 21. Risks and Trade-Offs

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Too many instructions | Slow Copilot | Scope and modularize rules |
| Hooks too heavy | Poor developer experience | Keep hooks fast and cached |
| Sonar unavailable locally | False confidence | CI quality gate remains mandatory |
| Persona ignored | Governance failure | Stop-hook validation |
| Token data unavailable | Incomplete cost tracking | Estimated mode with clear label |
| Over-governance | Low adoption | Apply strict gates only to significant tasks |
| False positives | Developer frustration | Allow approved-with-conditions verdict |

**Speaker Notes:**  
Be honest. The system is powerful, but badly implemented governance can become friction.

